<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P rates CSR's shelf registration.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P rates CSR's shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said it has assigned its long-term A rating to CSR Ltd's US$400 million shelf registration.  </p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating reflected CSR's strong market positions, competitive cost profile, meaningful product and geographic diversification, and management's prudent financial policies.</p>
<p>Under the self registraion, CSR or its subsidiary issuers, CSR America Inc and CSR Finance Ltd, can issue unsecured debt securities in one or more series in an aggregate amount up to US$400 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
